# ATS/ETS2 under Proton. The Wine virtual desktop is one 8360x2160 window; the game splits it into views
# (multimon_config.sii). It floats borderless over all three monitors, alone on the "ats" workspace on the TV.
# Hiding it just shows another workspace on the TV: the window is never resized, so the game never notices.
# Run /mnt/games/ats-on first (monitor layout, HEADLESS-4 off, docked bars hidden).
workspace ats output $center
for_window [class="^steam_app_(270880|227300)$"] move container to workspace ats, floating enable, border none, resize set 8360 2160, move absolute position 0 0, workspace ats
# Keep swayidle from locking and turning off the TV mid-drive (wheel/pedal input doesn't count as activity).
for_window [class="^steam_app_(270880|227300)$"] inhibit_idle open
# Hide/show the game to use the desktop.
bindsym $mod+Shift+f exec /mnt/games/ats-toggle
